[0;1;39m
COMMANDS[0m
  build       Build a program from its sources
  install     Install a program
  list        List installed binaries and versions
  search      Search available program versions
  switch      Switch the active binary
  uninstall   Uninstall a program
[0;1;39m
FLAGS[0m
  -h, --help           help for binary
      --scope string   Scope: project, user or system (default "project")
  -V, --verbose        Show diagnostic output and build commands

Use "tt binary <command> --help" for more information about a command.

